{"content_hash": "0381fcf5a0dc9f20", "version_id": 932, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Shennong Group chairman gives ex-wife $2.5bn in shares", "title_zh": "神农集团董事长离婚，分给前妻约25亿元股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 148, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "The chairman of a big pig farm company in Yunnan is divorced. He gave his ex-wife a large part of his shares. The company is also losing money because pig prices are low.", "lead_zh": "云南一家大型养猪企业的董事长离婚了。他把很大一部分股份给了前妻。由于猪价低迷，公司目前也在亏损。", "preview": "He Zuxun is the chairman of Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He moved 78.3 million shares to her. At the closing price", "preview_zh": "何祖训是神农集团的董事长。他和罗婉瑜结束了婚姻关系。他把7830.5万股过户给了她。按当日收盘价计算，这些股份价值约24.8亿元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 916, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 54.65, "size_bytes": 328896, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 55.225, "size_bytes": 332352, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 59.375, "size_bytes": 357264, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 51.525, "size_bytes": 310176, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 54.475, "size_bytes": 327744, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@aa52671/content/data/versions/932.json", "paragraphs": ["He Zuxun is the chairman of Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He moved 78.3 million shares to her. At the closing price that day, the shares were worth about 2.48 billion yuan.", "The two still signed an agreement to vote together. So He Zuxun still controls the company. His own shares fell from 49.6% to 34.72%. Luo Wanyu now holds about 14.88%.", "Pig prices are very low now. Shennong is trying to save cash. It stopped some building projects and paused its dividend. In the first nine months, revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan, but the company lost money.", "He Zuxun is 61. His son He Xinyang joined the company in 2019. He worked in many jobs and is now a vice general manager. But he is not on the board and owns no shares. He still needs more time to be ready."], "paragraphs_zh": ["何祖训是神农集团的董事长。他和罗婉瑜结束了婚姻关系。他把7830.5万股过户给了她。按当日收盘价计算，这些股份价值约24.8亿元。", "两人仍签署了一致行动协议，因此何祖训依然控制公司。他本人的持股从49.6%降到34.72%。罗婉瑜现在持有约14.88%。", "现在猪价很低。神农集团正努力保住现金。它停掉了一些建设项目，也暂停了分红。前三季度营收增长5%至41.2亿元，但公司处于亏损状态。", "何祖训今年61岁。他的儿子何昕阳2019年进入公司。他做过很多岗位，现在是副总经理。但他没有进入董事会，也不持有股份。他还需要更多时间才能接班。"], "body": "He Zuxun is the chairman of Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He moved 78.3 million shares to her. At the closing price that day, the shares were worth about 2.48 billion yuan.\n\nThe two still signed an agreement to vote together. So He Zuxun still controls the company. His own shares fell from 49.6% to 34.72%. Luo Wanyu now holds about 14.88%.\n\nPig prices are very low now. Shennong is trying to save cash. It stopped some building projects and paused its dividend. In the first nine months, revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan, but the company lost money.\n\nHe Zuxun is 61. His son He Xinyang joined the company in 2019. He worked in many jobs and is now a vice general manager. But he is not on the board and owns no shares. He still needs more time to be ready.", "body_zh": "何祖训是神农集团的董事长。他和罗婉瑜结束了婚姻关系。他把7830.5万股过户给了她。按当日收盘价计算，这些股份价值约24.8亿元。\n\n两人仍签署了一致行动协议，因此何祖训依然控制公司。他本人的持股从49.6%降到34.72%。罗婉瑜现在持有约14.88%。\n\n现在猪价很低。神农集团正努力保住现金。它停掉了一些建设项目，也暂停了分红。前三季度营收增长5%至41.2亿元，但公司处于亏损状态。\n\n何祖训今年61岁。他的儿子何昕阳2019年进入公司。他做过很多岗位，现在是副总经理。但他没有进入董事会，也不持有股份。他还需要更多时间才能接班。", "text": "He Zuxun is the chairman of Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He moved 78.3 million shares to her. At the closing price that day, the shares were worth about 2.48 billion yuan. The two still signed an agreement to vote together. So He Zuxun still controls the company. His own shares fell from 49.6% to 34.72%. Luo Wanyu now holds about 14.88%. Pig prices are very low now. Shennong is trying to save cash. It stopped some building projects and paused its dividend. In the first nine months, revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan, but the company lost money. He Zuxun is 61. His son He Xinyang joined the company in 2019. He worked in many jobs and is now a vice general manager. But he is not on the board and owns no shares. He still needs more time to be ready.", "vocab": [{"word": "chairman", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事长", "note": "公司最高负责人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "divorce", "pos": "noun", "zh": "离婚", "note": "也可作动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "常用复数 shares", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "worth", "pos": "adj", "zh": "价值为", "note": "be worth + 金额", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "control", "pos": "verb", "zh": "控制", "note": "control a company", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "save cash", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "节省现金", "note": "保现金", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "营收", "note": "公司收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "board", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事会", "note": "on the board 进入董事会", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-11T01:22:42.158123", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "He", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.425, "sm": 275, "em": 424, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Zuxun", "s": 0.425, "e": 0.925, "sm": 425, "em": 925, "cs": 3, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 0.925, "e": 1.062, "sm": 925, "em": 1062, "cs": 9, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "the", "s": 1.062, "e": 1.163, "sm": 1062, "em": 1162, "cs": 12, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "chairman", "s": 1.163, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1162, "em": 1549, "cs": 16, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "of", "s": 1.55, "e": 1.687, "sm": 1550, "em": 1687, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Shennong", "s": 1.688, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1687, "em": 2075, "cs": 28, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "Group", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.625, "sm": 2075, "em": 2624, "cs": 37, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ".", "s": 2.625, "e": 2.737, "sm": 2625, "em": 2737, "